WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.002
- OKAY, BUT DO I LOOK
IN THE CAMERA?

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:04.129
NO? OH, AT YOU?
ALL RIGHT. [chuckles]

00:00:04.129 --> 00:00:06.840
LIKE ON TELEVISION,
ALL RIGHT.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:10.344
[magical sparking]

00:00:10.344 --> 00:00:12.346
[booming]

00:00:12.346 --> 00:00:14.598
- NOW, KNOCK IT OFF!

00:00:14.598 --> 00:00:17.351
ALL THE STUPID-ASS GRAB-ASS
AND TOUCHY-FEELY BULL[bleep]!

00:00:17.351 --> 00:00:19.019
GOD DAMN!
I TOLD YOU THEY WAS ROTTEN.

00:00:23.607 --> 00:00:27.694
- I AM BARNABUS JACKSON,
PRINCIPAL HERE AT CLORTHO'S,

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:31.657
UH, VINCE CLORTHO HIGH.
UH--

00:00:31.657 --> 00:00:33.116
- [grunts]
- THIS STATION'S

00:00:33.116 --> 00:00:34.993
JUST A FORMALITY,
BUT--

00:00:34.993 --> 00:00:36.995
- HERE'S A BUNCH OF STUFF THAT
WE CONFISCATED JUST THIS WEEK.

00:00:36.995 --> 00:00:39.414
- STUFF--WE DON'T HAVE
TO SHOW THEM THAT.

00:00:39.414 --> 00:00:41.083
- HERE'S A WAND
WITH A SILENCER ON IT.

00:00:41.083 --> 00:00:44.586
WHY?
BUT I ASK AGAIN, WHY?

00:00:44.586 --> 00:00:46.255
ONE OUT OF FIVE GIRLS
IN THIS SCHOOL

00:00:46.255 --> 00:00:48.131
IS PREGNANT
WITH A DEMON BABY!

00:00:48.131 --> 00:00:49.716
- WELL--
- ONE OUT OF FIVE!

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:51.510
- OKAY.
[laughs]

00:00:51.510 --> 00:00:53.929
THE BABIES ARE EVIL,

00:00:53.929 --> 00:00:57.015
BUT THE MOTHERS,
THEY'RE GOOD KIDS.

00:00:57.015 --> 00:01:00.686
AS WE SAY AT CLORTHO'S,
"THERE'S NEVER A PORTAL

00:01:00.686 --> 00:01:04.022
THAT CANNOT BE OPENED
WITH INGENUITY AND RESPECT."

00:01:04.022 --> 00:01:05.607
[can spraying]
- NOW--

00:01:05.607 --> 00:01:05.941
- [scoffs]

00:01:08.694 --> 00:01:11.071
HOW YOU GON' BE USING
AN INVISIBLE CLOAK,

00:01:11.071 --> 00:01:12.489
WHEN I CAN SEE
YOU'RE TAGGING THE DAMN WALL?

00:01:12.489 --> 00:01:13.865
- [laughs]

00:01:13.865 --> 00:01:15.409
- DIME BAG OF PIXIE DUST.

00:01:15.409 --> 00:01:17.160
- [scoffs]
- CONTRABAND.

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:19.121
- SEE,
HERE'S THE THING,

00:01:19.121 --> 00:01:20.789
THE KIDS KNOW
THAT THE ONLY WAY TO FLY IS--

00:01:20.789 --> 00:01:23.125
- WIZARD PEPPER.
- UNBELIEVABLE.

00:01:23.125 --> 00:01:25.002
GET YOUR ASS
OUT MY OFFICE.

00:01:25.002 --> 00:01:27.087
I WILL TURN YOU
INTO A SPIDER!

00:01:27.087 --> 00:01:29.464
THEY'RE GOOD KIDS.

00:01:29.464 --> 00:01:31.425
[school bell ringing]
HOGWARTS AND CLORTHO'S,

00:01:31.425 --> 00:01:33.385
CLORTHO'S AND HOGWARTS,
THEY GO HAND-IN-HAND,

00:01:33.385 --> 00:01:36.305
THE BEST TOP TWO
WIZARDING SCHOOLS THERE ARE.

00:01:36.305 --> 00:01:38.181
BUT YOU KNOW,
OUT OF THESE TWO SCHOOLS,

00:01:38.181 --> 00:01:40.017
WE EACH HAVE A STRIKE.

00:01:40.017 --> 00:01:43.312
WE DO SCORE A LITTLE BIT LOWER
ON STANDARDIZED TESTS

00:01:43.312 --> 00:01:47.190
THAN HOGWARTS,
BUT THERE IS A CULTURAL BIAS.

00:01:47.190 --> 00:01:50.402
WE MAY NOT HAVE
A HUGE ENDOWMENT

00:01:50.402 --> 00:01:52.571
LIKE THEY GET
OVER AT HOGWARTS,

00:01:52.571 --> 00:01:54.698
AND YES,
SOME OF THE TEACHERS

00:01:54.698 --> 00:01:56.867
HAVE TO BUY THEIR OWN
NEWT'S EYES OR BAT WINGS OR--

00:01:56.867 --> 00:01:58.744
- ONE KID GOT TRANSFORMED
INTO A CAT.

00:01:58.744 --> 00:02:00.454
THEY CAN'T EVEN AFFORD
TO CHANGE HIM BACK.

00:02:00.454 --> 00:02:02.706
- THIS YOUNG MAN'S NAME
IS JAMAR.

00:02:02.706 --> 00:02:04.541
NORMALLY, YOU'RE NOT ALLOWED
TO TOUCH THE STUDENTS LIKE THIS

00:02:04.541 --> 00:02:06.460
WHEN THEY'RE
IN HUMAN FORM,

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:09.880
BUT WHEN THEY'RE A CAT,
WE JUST HAVE AT IT.

00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:12.090
SPORTS.

00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:14.176
EVERYBODY LOVES SPORTS.

00:02:14.176 --> 00:02:16.011
IT'S TRUE.
- NOT EVERYBODY.

00:02:16.011 --> 00:02:17.929
- THE HALLWAYS
ARE A-BLUSTER

00:02:17.929 --> 00:02:19.806
WITH THE CONVERSATION
OF OUR QUIDDITCH TEAM.

00:02:19.806 --> 00:02:21.641
- HALF THE TEAM
IS BACK HERE RIDING MOPS.

00:02:21.641 --> 00:02:22.684
WE GOT TWO LITTLE [bleep]
ON SWIFFERS.

00:02:22.684 --> 00:02:24.895
- LESTER!

00:02:24.895 --> 00:02:27.314
WHEN ALL IS SAID AND DONE,
THE AVERAGE CLORTHO STUDENT--

00:02:27.314 --> 00:02:28.440
[squeaking]
UH, SAY--

00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:29.650
THIS MOTHER--

00:02:29.650 --> 00:02:31.735
[laughs]

00:02:31.735 --> 00:02:33.403
SOMETIMES THE KIDS
THINK IT'S CUTE

00:02:33.403 --> 00:02:35.072
TO TURN THEMSELVES
INTO A RAT,

00:02:35.072 --> 00:02:37.282
[laughs]
SNEAK INTO MY OFFICE,

00:02:37.282 --> 00:02:39.159
PLAY A LITTLE JOKE
ON ME.

00:02:39.159 --> 00:02:40.577
WHO IS THAT?
TYRONE, IS THAT--IS THAT--?

00:02:40.577 --> 00:02:42.245
NO,
THAT'S AN ACTUAL RAT.

